Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:32.23,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Tonome?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.43,0:01:33.62,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:34.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:36.48,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Come on out, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.55,0:01:40.75,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Wow, looks grea—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:44.15,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Actually, it's just you in a high \Nschool uniform instead of a suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:47.63,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, it's not as if you \Ncan judge my age at a glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:49.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san is dressed like a student?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:51.89,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That's somehow extremely adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.58,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's really not worth \Ngetting excited over...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.93,0:01:58.76,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Your next investigation is \Nin a place frequented by students, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:00.85,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yeah, and since you \Ncan't eyeball his age,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:03.05,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,he's perfect for an undercover operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.34,0:02:06.41,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It fits, though, and I think \Nit gets the point across.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:07.56,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:09.04,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.09,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Next up, Kikira!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.47,Main,Madaraito,0,0,0,,Daichi! Can I take pictures?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:18.62,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,I'm not cosplaying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:21.19,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Man, you've got the vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.19,0:02:23.27,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,You'll totally fit in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:27.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It sounds like both Kikira-san's\N and my disguise are acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:30.58,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Well, that wraps up our prep—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.09,Main - Top,Kikira,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:33.38,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,Who said it's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:33.97,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:36.12,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You haven't modeled your disguise yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:40.68,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm good! It's nothing \Nanyone wants to see anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:44.55,Main,Kikira,0,0,0,,You don't get to say that \Nafter putting {\i1}me{\i0} through this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:46.09,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:48.52,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I tried it \Non before I got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.52,Main - Top,Kikira,0,0,0,,You sneaky little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:52.45,Main - Top,Jarashi,0,0,0,,It's not a big deal!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:53.81,Main - Top,Kikira,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!{bg}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:54.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, as long as it fits her, \NI'm sure it's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:57.82,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What is Jarashi's outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.29,0:03:00.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's the uniform of our \Nnext undercover target.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:03.41,Main,Maid,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:05.99,Main,Maid,0,0,0,,Moke-moke kyun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:09.86,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Why did I have to dress like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:11.80,Italics,Kikira,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:14.78,Italics,Kikira,0,0,0,,The target we're after is a regular here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:18.08,Italics,Kikira,0,0,0,,They're not here yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.08,0:03:20.85,Italics,Kikira,0,0,0,,but quit being shy \Nand maintain your cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:22.14,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'm not being shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:24.40,Main,Guest,0,0,0,,Hey, a new maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:26.13,Main,Guest,0,0,0,,Your pattern's really cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:29.80,Italics,Kikira,0,0,0,,Do your damn job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.64,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'm gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:39.24,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}Man... Plain fur is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:41.48,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}It lets your outfit be the focus,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.61,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}and it's so soft and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.67,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,That was so exhausting!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:57.38,Main - Top,Yako,0,0,0,,There, there! Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:04:01.62,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,The place was full of cute little girls \Nwho looked great in their maid uniforms!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.62,0:04:07.70,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But Akira-san said you blended in \Nand got information about your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:11.29,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like \NI wasn't gonna do my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:15.84,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'm just not cut out for this, \Nand I know I'm not cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:18.08,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,so it made me uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:18.82,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:21.82,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I don't know what you look like,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.62,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,so I can't weigh in on your cuteness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:25.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:29.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You {\i1}feel{\i0} very cute to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:32.82,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And I'm happy I get to \Nsnuggle your softness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:36.60,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,That's sexual harassment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:38.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:41.06,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Let me stroke {\i1}your{\i0} skin \Nand we'll call it even.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:42.58,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Isn't that sexual harassment, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:45.88,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's buy clothes again sometime!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.09,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,A real shopping spree!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:50.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Another girls' day out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.72,0:04:57.99,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,So cute! It's another knockout!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:01.73,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, this new one's cute, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:02.85,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The shopping spree is just for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:06.74,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:08.88,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I really don't want to \Nsteal all the focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:11.13,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Why don't we buy things for you as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:12.72,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, it's no big!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:15.50,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I love watching you try on outfits!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:18.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm not a dress-up doll, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:22.47,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm a bit worn out, \Nso I'm going to take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.47,0:05:25.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Please, enjoy shopping without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:26.60,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.53,0:05:34.02,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}My fur pattern is just so aggressive, \Nit makes it hard to pick out clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:37.75,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}The outfit's cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:42.35,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}But if I wear it, \Nthe two patterns will clash.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:46.88,Main,Staff,0,0,0,,You can try that on, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:49.14,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I {\i1}wouldn't{\i0} like that, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:56.88,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Shizuka, have you ever \Nenvied other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:59.11,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Envied them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:03.92,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Like... people who can see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:08.19,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I don't know what it's like to see, \Nso it never occurred to me to be jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:11.18,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:13.35,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What about you, Jarashi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.89,0:06:16.94,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I envy you a lot, Shizuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:18.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:20.70,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,You're all one color.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:21.81,Main,Shizuka,0,0,0,,One color?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:24.11,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,So cute clothes look good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.57,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:29.02,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So, Jarashi-san, you want to \Nwear cute clothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:30.75,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,But I can't pull it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:37.42,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,The maids and customers in the \Nmaid cafe all said I looked good, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:39.18,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,That's not what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:42.62,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,No matter how much everyone \Nelse compliments me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:45.83,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,it's not the kind of cute I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.68,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,The way I want to look is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:56.92,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,So I'll probably never \Nsee myself as cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:02.71,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Don't laugh, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:07.69,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,But... I've been thinking \Nof dying my fur...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.12,0:07:10.45,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Bleaching out my pattern so I'm plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.86,0:07:12.72,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:13.68,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,It's not that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.50,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is it more serious than it sounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:24.55,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Well, my family line comes \Nfrom bobcat people in the Americas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:28.04,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Our fur patterns \Nare proof of our heritage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:31.82,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I was born and raised here, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:34.94,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I guess I don't owe \Nanyone anything, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.94,0:07:38.02,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I just remembered \Nsomething Akira-san said!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:40.68,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,That's a fast change of subject!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:45.99,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san sometimes whispers his \Nthoughts about things he's looking at.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:49.59,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's a full moon tonight. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:52.27,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,Why is the full moon beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:57.88,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:03.45,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Is it beautiful to have a round golden \Nball against the blackness of the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:05.41,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:09.56,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,A yuzu fruit on a bed \Nof nori seaweed would be pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:10.84,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:15.50,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,When I was a child, I was taught \Nthat yuzu fruit is round and yellow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.50,0:08:18.88,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,and nori seaweed is big and black!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:20.24,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.61,0:08:22.81,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,I like that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.03,0:08:28.12,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's a full moon night just \Nfor you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:30.85,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,Just for Akira-san and me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:35.95,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,C'mon, Shizuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:39.86,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Don't get lost in thought \Nand giggle to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:42.45,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:43.97,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,So what was it Tonome said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.97,0:08:46.55,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um... that's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:47.44,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:51.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But it sounds like you're \Nfeeling torn about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:53.72,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:57.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Normally, when you make up your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:59.63,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,you don't need anyone's advice \Nto go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.52,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,True...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:06.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I think maybe you haven't found \Nthe answer you're comfortable with yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:08.76,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,The answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:11.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So you probably don't have to commit to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:17.56,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,"I need plain fur" or "I don't look \Ngood in cute clothing" just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.85,0:09:19.95,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What I mean is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:24.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,you may not really see your \Npattern as flaw after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.84,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,Y'know, we've got that in other colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:44.53,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Well, it clashes with my pattern, \Nso I figured I'd pass...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:49.65,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,That's fine. It's possible \Nto make mixed pattern outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:52.27,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,A pattern on a pattern!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:57.79,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,You'd be better with a cinched belt \Nand a color that matches your fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.22,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Well, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.80,0:10:02.27,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,Take your time, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:16.92,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Can you believe this, Tonome-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:18.70,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,No hugging, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:20.92,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Invisible hands are stopping me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:22.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:25.77,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,My wife's gone back\Nto her parents again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:26.85,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Did she say why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:30.41,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Her dad's in the hospital \Nand she has to look after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.41,0:10:32.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I see. How awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:33.40,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:36.97,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Let me stay here \Nuntil Light's back, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:38.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Why do you want that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:41.58,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I end up in a negative mood \Nwhen Light's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.77,0:10:46.04,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I thought I could vent some curses on \Nyour investigations like I did before...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:48.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But what about your shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.27,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,It's shuttered for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:54.08,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,If I don't vent my curses, they'll leak \Nout and affect all kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:55.50,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Affect things how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:57.79,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Just little misfortunes here and there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:03.52,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,So let me help until Light \Ngets back! Please, Tonome-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:07.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I understand, \Nbut how long will she be gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:09.40,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,About five month, she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:11.74,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a deadline?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:14.96,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Five months...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:19.79,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I won't get to see her \Nfor five whole months!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:21.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:23.14,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Five months?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:24.83,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}Five months sounds like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:29.74,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,How do I look, Jarashi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.00,0:11:32.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is it all working?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:33.88,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:36.01,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Hey, Shizuka, she's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.18,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:40.21,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,It's been so long, Light-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:41.62,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:44.05,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Thanks for checking in, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:45.79,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,How are you doing, Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:47.31,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.31,0:11:51.62,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Light-san, I heard your father \Nwas in the hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:53.01,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:54.32,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:57.48,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,He's not, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.48,0:11:59.29,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.29,0:12:02.21,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I am currently with child!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:04.10,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:05.12,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.25,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:08.12,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:09.96,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:13.13,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,So why aren't you \Ntelling Karma about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:15.22,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:19.64,Main,Light,0,0,0,,You know about Karma's dark \Nelf curse powers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:23.52,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I'm a white elf, which means I have \Nthe power of blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:26.37,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Normally, our powers \Ncancel each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:32.35,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,But elves as a race have \Na low pregnancy rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:35.03,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,so when one of us is carrying, \Nthey make a big deal out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.10,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:37.89,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Once we know we're pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:42.52,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,we spend time in the sacred elf \Nforest in the white elf village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:45.87,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,We perform rituals to pray \Nfor a safe birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:51.28,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,where the people spend every \Nday casting blessings on us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:55.04,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,and the elves in the village \Nsupport us every way they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:57.35,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,The whole princess treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:59.09,Main,Light,0,0,0,,It really is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:02.80,Main,Light,0,0,0,,But because the life \NI'm carrying is so precious,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:05.76,Main,Light,0,0,0,,and if anything were to happen to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:07.99,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I know he'd blame himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:11.26,Main,Light,0,0,0,,He'd think his curses are to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:18.02,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I know that would make our lives harder, \Nso I'm keeping it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:19.36,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,That's very frank of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:25.01,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,But don't you feel nervous \Nwithout him around?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:26.99,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.99,0:13:30.93,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,It's more that I'm worried about \Nwhat he'll get up to without me there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.93,0:13:34.02,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I won't tell her that he \Nimmediately went crying to Akira-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:36.68,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,He stormed our agency in tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:39.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, Jarashi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.24,0:13:46.55,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It's getting rather cold \Nat night, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:48.42,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What shall we get to eat tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:51.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm craving something warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.56,0:13:54.73,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Hot pot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:58.06,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.06,0:13:59.84,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What kind of hot pot shall we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:01.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What about tomato hot pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:04.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'd love that! Shall \Nwe have it at my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.64,0:14:08.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well, I'll cut the vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:11.02,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You wash them, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.02,0:14:12.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:16.40,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Is it all right for \NShizuka-san to use a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:21.58,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Well, she lives alone, \Nso I'm sure she's fine. Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:24.04,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:26.98,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,W-Watch what you're cutting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.98,0:14:28.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,...Isn't something you \Nneed to do, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:32.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This makes me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:34.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What does?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:37.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We've gotten closer \Nsince we started dating,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:39.82,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,and I've been able to learn \Nso much more about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:46.29,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I've realized something \Nabout you recently, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.31,0:14:48.24,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:52.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,There's a smell \Nthat I thought was yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:54.94,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You mentioned that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.23,0:14:59.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But I think that was actually \Nthe smell of your suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:02.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, my suit refresher?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:08.31,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Would you like to check {\i1}my{\i0} smell again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.21,0:15:11.26,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Check... your smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.69,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:16.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,W-Well, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.68,0:15:20.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so you don't confuse it with my \Nclothing smell... should I get undressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:22.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.01,0:15:25.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-You'd better not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:35.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san, shall I add the pasta?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:38.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'd better not drink too much soup, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:44.41,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,That warmed me right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.41,0:15:46.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We have dessert today as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.46,0:15:47.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:49.55,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,CUSTARD CREAM PUFF
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:49.55,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:51.17,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,I-Is this...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:54.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I bought them while I was \Nat the supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.19,0:15:56.48,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.19,0:15:59.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Cream puffs are a problem for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:01.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.84,0:16:03.33,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You see, when I eat them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:09.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I end up getting ambushed by cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:10.74,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:25.46,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,L: CAN WE TALK? - K: I CAN'T WAIT! VIDEO CALL? \NL: I'D RATHER NOT. VOICE ONLY. - K: YOOOOOOOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:31.46,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,KARMA\N LIME AUDIO  CALLING
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.91,0:16:34.04,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Hello! Is that you, Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:35.44,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:39.88,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,It's gotten cold, huh? You keeping warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:44.50,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Five months is a long time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.83,0:16:47.09,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:50.06,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.77,0:16:56.46,Main,Light,0,0,0,,You're not actually angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:58.03,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,Light?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:17:00.92,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:03.54,Main,Light,0,0,0,,That's why I went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:06.19,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,I have more resources here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:08.14,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,And I'm keeping other things from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.14,0:17:10.91,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,B-But why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:13.20,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:17.16,Main,Light,0,0,0,,When we got married...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.22,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Maybe we shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.76,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,You're backing out {\i1}now{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.76,0:17:25.22,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,A dark elf like me doesn't belong \Nwith a white elf like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:28.48,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,Come on, we've been through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:31.01,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,Maybe our parents' \Ngeneration had conflict,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:33.19,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,but that has nothing to do with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:35.22,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Th-That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:37.88,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm just not sure how my \Ncurse will affect you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:38.69,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.69,0:17:41.09,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,Do you think my blessing \Npower is worth nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.09,0:17:42.92,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,It cancels out your curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:45.29,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Look, I wanna be with you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:49.20,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,But my curse powers are \Nthe opposite of your blessings...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.46,0:17:51.67,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,so I don't know if I could \Nreally make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:55.20,Flashback,Light,0,0,0,,It's not your job to make me happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.20,0:17:57.88,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,But if anything were to happen to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.03,0:17:58.70,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:07.92,Main,Light,0,0,0,,You tried to run away because you were \Nafraid of your curse's effects, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:11.44,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I thought that, this time, \Nit might really be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:16.84,Main,Light,0,0,0,,That's why I didn't tell you \Nabout my pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.37,0:18:20.08,Main,Light,0,0,0,,You'd just run away, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:24.35,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,{M}I'm awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:26.40,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to say it that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.36,0:18:30.60,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,I knew you were pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.12,0:18:34.88,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,And yeah... I did try to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:39.63,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,BABY CLUB\NALL YOU NEED TO RAISE A HEALTHY CHILD
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:40.29,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,I won't run again. I swore I \Nwouldn't when we got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:43.50,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I made you \Nkeep this to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:48.22,Main,Light,0,0,0,,How did you find out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.46,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,Well, you said your father \Nwas hospitalized,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:53.78,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,so I got worried and called him...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:57.15,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Hello! Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:59.13,Flashback,Twin,0,0,0,,Shut up! Stay away from my grandchild!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.18,0:19:02.01,Flashback,Karma,0,0,0,,Grandchild?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:05.49,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Darn it, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:10.01,Italics,Light,0,0,0,,And if you knew, why didn't you tell me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.01,0:19:12.80,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Well, I figured you wanted it \Nto be a surprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:15.25,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I didn't, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.52,0:19:19.60,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,Well, I'm relieved to hear \Nyour parents are okay, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.87,0:19:24.48,Main,Light,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:25.80,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,Hey, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:30.44,Main,Karma,0,0,0,,By the way, what was that other \Nthing you're keeping from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:35.89,Main,Light,0,0,0,,Wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:38.72,Italics,Karma,0,0,0,,Sure, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.11,0:19:49.23,Main,Rabbit,0,0,0,,Are you looking for something, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:51.52,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,O-Oh, not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.21,0:19:54.44,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}I guess that person isn't here...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:58.72,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'm looking for clothing \Nthat looks good with my pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.72,0:20:02.75,Main,Rabbit,0,0,0,,Well, how about these?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:06.14,Main,Rabbit,0,0,0,,How do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:08.72,Main,Rabbit,0,0,0,,It looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:11.40,Main,Rabbit,0,0,0,,This is a foreign brand, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:12.87,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:14.48,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:19.98,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I just can't trust the \Nchoices of plain-furred staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:23.24,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}But the stuff I bought that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.61,0:20:26.77,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}When someone with a pattern gives me \Nadvice, I can let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:30.29,Italics,Jarashi,0,0,0,,{M}I wish I could talk to them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:32.00,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:32.67,Main,Rabbit,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:36.88,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I believe you have a lizard-like \Nperson on your staff...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.42,0:20:40.40,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,Heya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:42.92,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Oh, you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.92,0:20:44.96,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,I was handling stock in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:48.24,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,Were you the one looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:51.12,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:52.80,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:21:00.36,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,Did I make you mad somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.67,0:21:05.15,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I want advice on an outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:08.02,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,Hey, that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:10.00,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.50,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,How's it look?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.19,0:21:20.99,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Showing off my legs...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:22.94,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,My pattern doesn't get in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:26.65,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,Getting the right pattern \Nsize balances it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:29.60,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,But you've got such a great figure,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:31.88,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,anything looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:34.17,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.16,0:21:39.48,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,If anything looked good on me, \NI wouldn't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:44.86,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,I'm Ako Mizunami.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:48.45,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,My business cards, fresh off the press.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.45,0:21:51.04,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,It's been my dream to open my own shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:52.76,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,catering to patterned people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.05,0:21:56.82,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,So I hope I can count on your patronage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.74,0:21:58.80,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:01.47,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'll definitely have to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:03.52,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,I'm Luna Jarashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:05.37,Main,Jarashi,0,0,0,,A potential future regular!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.30,0:22:08.28,Main,Mizunami,0,0,0,,Glad to have ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:09.97,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 6: A PLACE WHERE I (YOU) BELONG\N TO BE CONTINUED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,
